<title>PORTUGAL: Yield 5.7160 pct on Portuguese 91-day bills.</title>
<headline>Yield 5.7160 pct on Portuguese 91-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield rose to 5.7160 percent, from 5.7100 percent previously, at the Institute for Public Credit Management's sale of 91-day bills, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The Institute placed all of the 15 billion on offer. The last such sale was on July 3.</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3150035</p>
